+`RBOPS_BASE_REF` must be the phase's base commit — the pipeline records it in
+`phases/phase-NNN/.base` — because the gate's diff-based checks (test quota,
+`edge_*` count, the failure-assertion rule) read `git diff <base>`. Without it
+the base is `HEAD`, the diff is empty, and the gate reports "no changed files
+detected" for a phase whose work is in the working tree.
+
+Same observation `phases/phase-087/REPORT.md` records, and it is worth the next
+phase knowing: the gate is not "not run", it is one `../` away.
